What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/firmware_version
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) Version of the firmware the Flipper One MCU is running,
		as major.minor.patch. An image without version information
		reads as 0.0.0. Reading fails with EOPNOTSUPP on MCU firmware
		that does not support try-before-you-buy images, which can
		only be updated over USB.

		Images themselves are uploaded through the firmware upload
		class as /sys/class/firmware/flipper-one-mcu/, see
		sysfs-class-firmware. Both UF2 files and raw binary images
		are accepted. The MCU stages a new image in its inactive slot
		and switches to it once the host reboots or powers off, and
		then power-cycles the host. Until then this keeps reporting
		the old version.

		Format: %u.%u.%u.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/staged_version
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) Version of the image last staged in the inactive MCU
		firmware slot since the MCU started, as major.minor.patch, or
		0.0.0 if none was. Reading fails with EOPNOTSUPP on MCU
		firmware that does not support try-before-you-buy images.

		Format: %u.%u.%u.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/boot_slot
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) MCU firmware slot the MCU booted from. Reading fails
		with EOPNOTSUPP on MCU firmware that does not support
		try-before-you-buy images.

		Access: Read

		Valid values:
		 - ``A``
		 - ``B``

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/boot_type
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) How the MCU last booted. Reading fails with EOPNOTSUPP on
		MCU firmware that does not support try-before-you-buy images.

		Access: Read

		Valid values:
		 - ``normal``: an ordinary reset or power-up
		 - ``flash-update``: the switch to a newly staged image
		 - ``unknown``: a boot type this driver doesn't know

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/target
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) Name of the MCU firmware build target that matches this
		board revision, as used in the names of published MCU
		firmware images (for example "f1"). Userspace uses it to pick
		the image to upload; the driver cannot tell from an image
		which target it was built for.

		Absent on board revisions the driver does not know.

		Format: %s.
